  "why": "d3_seed_variance.py VD_3 compares a SINGLE-category bootstrap mean against the published value, which the CSV documents as a macro average over all categories of the dataset (interaction_by_condition.csv has no category column).  For any multi-category dataset that comparison can never reach 1e-9, so the gate as implemented reports a false failure.  This file recomputes the gate with the matching definition: macro over the categories of a given (seed, shot), then compare with the published per-condition value.",
